BonVote — Resi Enskripsyon
<%= @election&.title %>
========================================

Bonjou <%= @user.full_name.presence || @user.email %>,

Enskripsyon w pou vote konplete. Men referans ou:

    <%= @record.voter_reference %>

<% if @record.polling_station.present? -%>
Biwo Vòt: BV #<%= @record.polling_station.bv_number %>
Sant:     <%= @record.polling_station.polling_center&.name %>
<% if @record.polling_station.polling_center&.formatted_address.present? -%>
Adrès:    <%= @record.polling_station.polling_center.formatted_address %>
<% end -%>
<% if @record.polling_station.polling_center&.contact_phone.present? -%>
Telefòn:  <%= @record.polling_station.polling_center.contact_phone %><% if @record.polling_station.polling_center.contact_hours.present? %> (<%= @record.polling_station.polling_center.contact_hours %>)<% end %>
<% end -%>
<% else -%>
Biwo vòt ap atribye byento.
<% end -%>

<% if @record.bonvote_signature.present? -%>
[Siyen pa BonVote · Pwotokòl CEP]
BonVote bay resi sa a dapre pwotokòl CEP la. Resi PDF la tache nan imèl sa a
— ou ka enprime l oswa sere l nan telefòn ou.
<% else -%>
[Pa siyen]
Resi sa a poko siyen. L ap siyen lè enskripsyon w konplete.
<% end -%>

Pote resi a (enprime oswa sou telefòn) jou eleksyon an, ansanm ak yon pyès
idantite ofisyèl (CIN oswa paspò).

Pa pataje referans sa a. Li valab sèlman pou ou menm.

----
BonVote suiv pwotokòl CEP la. Imèl sa a se yon kopi BonID.
Si ou pa t enskri, reponn imèl sa a.
